OL,3,GNEWSAWhat to do with your fridge if it
OL,4,Aneeds dumping
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of fridges and freezers in
OL,7,FLondon are unable to be recycled as
OL,8,Fpart of a national issue following the
OL,9,Fclosure of specialist treatment
OL,10,Ffacilities and shortage in capacity to
OL,11,Fde-gas and recycle the appliances.
OL,13,FEarlier this year, the Local Government
OL,14,FAssociation warned that "a significant
OL,15,Fbacklog" was emerging nationally and
OL,16,Fdozens of councils had been forced to
OL,17,Fstop or restrict fridge and freezer
OL,18,Fcollections from residents.
OL,20,FIn London, a number of councils are no
OL,21,Flonger accepting bulky waste
OL,22,Fcollections of fridges and freezers.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
